WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:01.951
Welcome to APEX DEV.

2
00:00:02.501 --> 00:00:07.029
Before the workshop, you only need to share one real school challenge in Pre-work.

3
00:00:07.579 --> 00:00:09.899
Select Get started to create an account.

4
00:00:10.449 --> 00:00:16.799
Use your real name as your nickname, enter your email address, and choose a password of at least eight characters.

5
00:00:17.349 --> 00:00:22.834
This walkthrough uses the sample preview. After signing in, choose Submit pre-work on Home.

6
00:00:23.384 --> 00:00:26.800
Read the two examples, or open the guide if you need help.

7
00:00:27.350 --> 00:00:28.760
Then select New post.

8
00:00:29.310 --> 00:00:33.533
Fill in WHO, TASK, SITUATION, and ROOT CAUSE.

9
00:00:34.083 --> 00:00:39.937
Describe a specific, recurring problem. Do not include student names or sensitive details.

10
00:00:40.487 --> 00:00:43.877
Your statement appears automatically as you fill in the four boxes.

11
00:00:44.427 --> 00:00:47.715
Review and edit it if needed, then select Publish post.

12
00:00:48.265 --> 00:00:53.553
That's everything to do before the workshop. We'll build and share the web app together during the session.
